# Local development needs no database settings: without DATABASE_URL the app uses an embedded
# Postgres (PGlite) in .pglite/, filled by `npm run db:reset`.
#
# Neon (production) goes into .env.neon, NOT .env – otherwise `npm run dev` would write to it:
#   DATABASE_URL=postgresql://…   (Vercel → teamplaner → Settings → Environment Variables)
# Used only by `npm run db:migrate:neon` and `npm run db:seed:neon`.

# Admin API (Claude, see .claude/skills/teamplaner-admin/SKILL.md): a random token and its SHA-256.
# The server only gets the hash; the token stays with Claude. Same pair in .env.neon for production.
#   ADMIN_TOKEN=…
#   ADMIN_TOKEN_HASH=…
